sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Channel as Mobile/Web App
    participant WAF as WAF / DDoS Protection
    participant APIGW as API Gateway
    participant IAM as Customer IAM
    participant BFF as Digital API / BFF Layer
    participant AccountSvc as Account Information Service
    participant ODS as Read Models / ODS
    participant Audit as Audit / Observability

    Customer->>Channel: Open account overview
    Channel->>WAF: HTTPS request
    WAF->>APIGW: Forward allowed request
    APIGW->>IAM: Validate token / session
    IAM-->>APIGW: Authorized customer context
    APIGW->>BFF: Route account overview request
    BFF->>AccountSvc: Get customer account view
    AccountSvc->>ODS: Query account read model
    ODS-->>AccountSvc: Account data + freshness metadata
    AccountSvc->>Audit: Emit read/access telemetry
    AccountSvc-->>BFF: Account view response
    BFF-->>APIGW: Client-shaped response
    APIGW-->>Channel: Response
    Channel-->>Customer: Show accounts, balances, freshness indicator
